---
// 401 Unauthorized page - standalone without BaseLayout for minimal footprint
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>401 - Authentication Required | Killington Getaway</title>
  <meta name="description" content="You need to be signed in to access this page." />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/icon.png" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;700;900&family=Bebas+Neue&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --brand-navy: #0B1619;
      --brand-green: #2d94e3;
      --brand-blue: #00B4D8;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background: var(--brand-navy);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .bg-decor {
      position: absolute;
      width: 500px;
      height: 500px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(80px);
      animation: pulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .bg-decor-1 { top: 0; right: 0; margin-right: -16rem; margin-top: -16rem; background: rgba(45, 148, 227, 0.1); }
    .bg-decor-2 { bottom: 0; left: 0; margin-left: -16rem; margin-bottom: -16rem; background: rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.1); animation-delay: 1s; }
    @keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.5; } }
    @keyframes bounce { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-20px); } }
    .content { max-width: 42rem; position: relative; z-index: 10; }
    .icon-box {
      width: 8rem;
      height: 8rem;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border-radius: 2.5rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 4rem;
      margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      animation: bounce 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    h1 {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(5rem, 15vw, 9rem);
      color: white;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    h2 {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);
      color: var(--brand-green);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    h2 span { color: white; }
    p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 32rem;
      margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    }
    .buttons { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn {
      font-weight: 900;
      padding: 1.25rem 3rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--brand-green); color: white; box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: rgba(45, 148, 227, 0.9); }
    .btn-secondary { background: transparent; color: white; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="bg-decor bg-decor-1"></div>
  <div class="bg-decor bg-decor-2"></div>

  <div class="content">
    <div class="icon-box">🎫</div>
    <h1>401</h1>
    <h2>Ticket <span>Required</span></h2>
    <p>
      You need to be signed in to access this area. Grab your lift ticket — log in and we'll get you back on the mountain in no time.
    </p>
    <div class="buttons">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Back to Home</a>
      <a href="/contact-us" class="btn btn-secondary">Get Help</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
